@startuml
title PayLink - Pay a Bill

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber "<b>0"

actor Customer
participant "Payment\nProcessing" as PP
participant "Accounts\nand Wallet" as WL
participant "Biller\nCatalog" as BC
participant "Fees and\nCommissions" as FE
participant "Fraud\nChecks" as FR
participant "Biller\nIntegration" as BI
participant "Biller\n(e.g. ElectroCo)" as BL
participant "Notifications" as NT
participant "Reconciliation" as RC

== 1. Login and limits ==
Customer -> PP : Login
PP -> WL : Identify customer and\nget verification level
WL --> PP : Customer, level, daily limit

== 2. Bill inquiry (separate request) ==
Customer -> PP : Select biller, enter bill details
PP -> BC : Get biller and required fields
BC --> PP : Biller (active, min/max amount)

alt Biller supports live inquiry
    PP -> BI : Inquiry(bill details)
    BI -> BL : Inquiry request
    BL --> BI : Amount due (350.00 EGP)
    BI --> PP : Amount due
else No live inquiry (e.g. TopUpNet, NetCo)
    note over PP, FE
        No call to the biller.
        Customer enters the amount.
        Fee and total are calculated locally.
    end note
end

== 3. Fee and total ==
PP -> FE : Calculate fee(biller, amount)
FE --> PP : Fee (2.50 EGP)
PP --> Customer : Amount, fee and total (352.50 EGP)

note over Customer, PP
    Inquiry and payment are two separate requests.
    The inquiry above ends here. The payment below
    starts when the customer confirms.
end note

Customer -> PP : Confirm payment\n(with idempotency key)

== 4. Fraud checks ==
PP -> FR : Check(daily limit, velocity, blocked account)
FR --> PP : Pass or fail

alt Fraud check fails or funds are insufficient
    note right of PP : State: Rejected
    PP --> Customer : Payment rejected (clear reason)
    PP -> NT : Payment result event (Rejected)
    NT --> Customer : SMS and push notification
else Checks pass and wallet has enough funds
    == 5. Hold the money ==
    PP -> WL : Hold(total)
    WL --> PP : Funds held\n(available down, held up)
    note right of PP : State: FundsHeld

    == 6. Call the biller ==
    PP -> BI : Pay(unique reference, amount)
    BI -> BL : Payment request
    note right of PP : State: SentToBiller

    == 7. Confirmation ==
    alt Biller confirms (paid)
        BL --> BI : Paid
        BI --> PP : Confirmed
        PP -> WL : Turn hold into final charge,\ncredit fee income,\nrecord agent commission (if agent)
        WL --> PP : Done
        note right of PP : State: Completed
        PP -> NT : Payment result event (Completed)
    else Biller refuses
        BL --> BI : Refused (error code)
        BI --> PP : Refused
        note right of PP : State: Failed
        PP -> WL : Release hold (immediately)
        WL --> PP : Funds returned
        note right of PP : State: Refunded
        PP -> NT : Payment result event (Failed)
    else No answer within 10 seconds
        BI --> PP : Timeout
        note right of PP : State: Unknown\nMoney stays held
        PP --> Customer : Payment being processed\n(no completion or failure receipt sent)
    end

    note over PP, BL
        Asynchronous and batch billers (main flow above is synchronous):
        State stays SentToBiller until the result arrives.
        - TopUpNet: accepts first, then calls the callback URL later
          with "success" or "failed".
        - NetCo: payments go in the daily file; the result file
          arrives the next morning.
    end note

    == 8. Receipt ==
    NT --> Customer : SMS and push notification\n(Completed or Failed)
end

== 9. Night reconciliation ==
BL -> RC : Settlement file (all payments received)
RC -> PP : Read PayLink payment records
PP --> RC : Payments
RC -> RC : Compare with settlement file
RC --> RC : Report any difference
@enduml